title: "promaterialpy"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-03-09
abstract: "A curated Python library collecting mechanical, structural, and materials engineering datasets. It includes standard commercial specifications, international design codes (ANSI, DIN, ISO, GOST), pure element stiffness profiles, and fiber-reinforced composite manufacturing parameters optimized for engineering design, computational modeling, and research."
keywords:
  - materials engineering
  - mechanical engineering
  - structural design
  - datasets
  - youngs modulus
  - composite materials
  - standard specifications
  - python
